### Auth Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Register Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newcustomer{{$timestamp}}",
  "email": "customer{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "full_name": "New Customer",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### 2. Register Customer - Duplicate Email (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer2",
  "email": "same@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Customer Two",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

### 3. Register Customer - Missing Required Field (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "incompletecustomer",
  "email": "incomplete@example.com"
}

### 4. Login - Success
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Login - Wrong Password (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 6. Login - Non-existent User (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistentuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save Login Token for Later Use
@authToken = <replace with actual token from login response>

### 7. Verify Valid Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{authToken}}"
}

### 8. Verify Invalid Token (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "invalid.fake.token"
}

### 9. Get Current User Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Get Current User - No Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 11. Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/update-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Updated Customer Name",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

### 12. Change Password - Success
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword456!"
}

### 13. Change Password - Wrong Old Password (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "wrongoldpassword",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword789!"
}

### 14. Register Staff Account (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newstaff{{$timestamp}}",
  "email": "staff{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "StaffPassword123!",
  "full_name": "New Staff Member",
  "phone": "0111222333",
  "position": "Delivery",
  "employment_type": "full_time"
}

### 15. Test Login with New Credentials (After Password Change)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "NewSecurePassword456!"
}
